us girl. She comes by the Sakuragi cake shop on a regular basis to feed her sweet tooth, but she also tries to tempt Takashi to come visit her establishment. She works as a hostess in a bunny bar called \"Carrot\". This bunny bar is also located in the shopping mall where Sakuragi's cake shop is. The hostesses must wear certain uniforms - bunny costumes! Kaori has always been a very quiet and introverted girl, but recently, she's started to like the idea of being looked at."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Ben Woodhouse's Walkthrough and JAST USA"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c27891"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2a/2a5d1822e2e48b69f9a36dc03ca08f4a5af53f6032aaa6b3dc80659ca01b69f1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/04/04605ebf0ff39cd1008a87914bcdd4e48edca36be8d301087f5665ccfdde414c.webp","width":171,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"原島 瑠璃子","creatorId":"vndb:s1010","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1010","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1010","name":"原島 瑠璃子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:32489","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c29689","characterName":"西谷 明夫","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c29689"},"originalCharacterName":"西谷 明夫","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1d/1d0c48d7030f40910fc1c368d89880af0514d85d2f6b6b484a13b2b10b2d0da8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/0a/0a3b8b74878b3318db488ee2fcef93898a771c8b9c4a30783aad32d776d5